              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ENo validation is applied to this example.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe read-only and character count options are mutually exclusive, since it does not make sense to have a dynamic character count on a read-only field.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
